        "end": 17.4,
        "wordStarts": [15.16, 15.66, 15.86, 16.1, 16.38, 16.52, 16.72]
      },
      {
        "text": "then shopping, then collecting the kids from school.",
        "start": 17.7,
        "end": 20.9,
        "wordStarts": [17.82, 18.04, 18.96, 19.1, 19.52, 19.8, 20.04, 20.26]
      },
      {
        "text": "I'm exhausted, Beth. What have you been doing today?",
        "start": 20.6,
        "end": 23.8,
        "wordStarts": [20.74, 20.92, 21.66, 22.34, 22.6, 22.7, 22.8, 22.98, 23.16]
      },
      {
        "text": "Not much. Just sitting around, doing nothing,",
