        "start": 27.5,
        "end": 30.4,
        "wordStarts": [27.68, 28.24, 28.52, 28.74, 29.38, 29.8]
      },
      {
        "text": "Don't you have any work to do?",
        "start": 30.1,
        "end": 31.7,
        "wordStarts": [30.24, 30.36, 30.5, 30.68, 30.84, 31.1, 31.28]
      },
      {
        "text": "It may not look it, Neil, but I'm actually as busy as a bee.",
