      },
      {
        "text": "If you've seen nature documentaries about worker bees flying from flower to flower,",
        "start": 35.7,
        "end": 40.8,
        "wordStarts": [35.82, 35.98, 36.18, 36.4, 36.86, 37.54, 38.08, 38.48, 38.78, 39.26, 39.62, 39.94, 40.14]
      },
      {
        "text": "you probably think animals are always on the move.",
