        "wordStarts": [52.6, 52.82, 52.96, 53.34, 53.8, 54.04, 54.46, 54.88, 55.04, 55.44, 55.68, 56]
      },
      {
        "text": "why have some animals evolved to do nothing?",
        "start": 56.5,
        "end": 60.1,
        "wordStarts": [56.68, 56.94, 57.14, 57.44, 58, 58.48, 58.9, 59.18]
      },
      {
        "text": "And if it's good enough for animals, wood being lazy work for humans too.",
        "start": 59.7,
        "end": 65.1,
        "wordStarts": [59.8, 60.6, 60.8, 61, 61.12, 61.32, 61.56, 62.3, 62.58, 62.94, 63.42, 63.84, 64.04, 64.42]
      },
