    "source": {
      "kind": "youtube",
      "videoId": "N2uQWfV6Jr4"
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "text": "2016, a group of researchers—oh,",
        "start": 6.7,
        "end": 10.3,
        "wordStarts": [6.89, 8.07, 8.23, 8.41, 8.61]
      },
      {
        "text": "a new photo! These researchers set out to measure—did I get that email?",
        "start": 10.3,
        "end": 14.9,
        "wordStarts": [10.49, 10.67, 10.81, 11.69, 11.87, 12.41, 12.71, 12.91, 13.05, 13.93, 14.05, 14.19, 14.33]
      },
      {
        "text": "They measured—what was that? Sorry.",
        "start": 15.4,
        "end": 18.4,
        "wordStarts": [15.51, 15.69, 16.87, 16.95, 17.65]
      },
      {
        "text": "The researchers set out to measure the length of,",
        "start": 19.1,
        "end": 21.7,
        "wordStarts": [19.29, 19.43, 19.73, 20.15, 20.39, 20.51, 20.71, 20.87, 21.13]
      },
      {
        "text": "well, our attention spans. Participants downloaded a program",
        "start": 21.8,
        "end": 27.2,
        "wordStarts": [21.99, 23.13, 23.27, 23.61, 25.25, 25.83, 26.23, 26.53]
      },
      {
        "text": "that tracked how long they stayed focused on a single computer application before switching to another.",
        "start": 26.8,
        "end": 32.8,
        "wordStarts": [26.91, 27.25, 27.57, 27.83, 28.05, 28.21, 28.51, 28.89, 29.25, 29.37, 29.63, 30.07, 30.73, 31.41, 31.85, 32.15]
      },
      {
        "text": "On average, users stuck with a single task for 40 seconds,",
        "start": 32.3,
        "end": 37.6,
        "wordStarts": [32.49, 33.89, 34.49, 34.75, 35.11, 35.35, 35.47, 35.69, 36.21, 36.51, 36.85]
      },
      {
        "text": "down from 75 seconds measured just five years earlier.",
        "start": 37.5,
        "end": 42.4,
        "wordStarts": [37.63, 38.21, 38.45, 39.07, 39.69, 40.27, 40.77, 41.27, 41.65]
      },
      {
        "text": "This doesn't necessarily mean our attention spans are fundamentally getting shorter,",
        "start": 42.9,
        "end": 47.8,
        "wordStarts": [43.05, 43.51, 43.83, 44.31, 44.79, 45.01, 45.35, 45.73, 46.09, 46.55, 47.03]
      },
      {
        "text": "rather, in today's world, our attention is being pulled in more directions than ever before.",
        "start": 47.9,
        "end": 53.7,
        "wordStarts": [48.01, 48.65, 48.83, 49.21, 49.89, 50.03, 50.35, 50.63, 50.85, 51.17, 51.45, 51.69, 52.19, 52.71, 53.01]
      },
      {
        "text": "This can make finding focus for work, school",
        "start": 53.7,
        "end": 57.4,
        "wordStarts": [53.85, 54.19, 54.37, 54.53, 54.85, 55.25, 55.95, 56.71]
      },
      {
        "text": "and even the things we love feel almost impossible.",
        "start": 56.9,
        "end": 61.5,
        "wordStarts": [57.09, 57.71, 57.97, 58.17, 58.37, 58.55, 58.91, 59.71, 60.59]
      },
      {
        "text": "Thankfully, there are ways we can improve and better protect our attention spans,",
        "start": 61.1,
